@startuml
scale 2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #2F5597
skinparam arrowColor #5B6675

title 图 3-6 预约状态图

state "待确认" as Pending
state "已确认" as Confirmed
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "已拒绝" as Rejected
state "已过期" as Expired
state "已完成" as Completed

[*] --> Pending : 创建预约 [商品已发布]
Pending --> Confirmed : 卖家确认 [24h 内]
Pending --> Cancelled : 买家取消
Pending --> Cancelled : 管理员违规下架
Pending --> Rejected : 卖家拒绝 [原因必填]
Pending --> Expired : 24h 未确认
Confirmed --> Completed : 卖家标记完成 [48h 内]
Confirmed --> Cancelled : 买家取消 [假设]
Confirmed --> Cancelled : 管理员违规下架
Confirmed --> Expired : 48h 未完成
Cancelled --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

note right of Confirmed
  商品保持已预约状态，
  等待线下交易。
end note

note bottom of Cancelled
  管理员违规下架时，同一事务内将有效预约置为已取消，
  取消原因记为“商品被下架”。
end note

note bottom of Expired
  预约过期后商品恢复为已发布。
end note

@enduml
